      "AHMENTIO",
      "Chicago Helicopter Airways operates a fleet of\nfive 12-passenger Sikorsky S-58C Helicopters in daily\nscheduled passenger service between Midway Air-\nport, O'Hare Field, downtown Chicago and several\nsuburban communities. The S-58 is the largest, fast-\nest (115 mph cruising\nspeed) and most comfortable\npassenger helicopter in the world.\nP29004\n(plastichrome\nby COLOURPICTURE PUBLISHERS, INC., Boston 15, Mass., U.S.A.\nPUT\nSTAMP\nHERE\nPOST CARD\n2015.1660478"
